    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document extends the Multi-threaded Routing Toolkit (MRT) export
format for Border Gateway Protocol (BGP) routing information by
supporting the advertisement of multiple paths in BGP extensions.</t>
    </abstract>
